 \qquad (U_rF)(y)=F(\Sigma_r y)
 \tag{IGO24}
\]
is an isometry, since its squared norm is exactly the defining
pushforward integral. Its range is closed. We use complex
inner products linear in the second variable. For $r\geq2$
