\[
 \varepsilon_{ab}(S)
 =\frac{\chi(S)}{(S-\beta_{ab})\chi'(\beta_{ab})}.
 \tag{OKA2}
\]
These denominators are nonzero: equality of two roots in OKA1,
on comparing real and imaginary parts and using $\delta>0$,
