 \end{gathered}\tag{CTV3}
\]
The original phases $i^{-q}$ and $i^{-q'}$ have modulus one;
they occur exactly as written in the coefficient maps.
For every lower pair one has
$\omega'_{ab}=\omega_{a+4,b+4}$. Hence, with the complete
