 |y-\omega'_{ab}|\ge|\operatorname{Im}\omega'_{ab}|
        \ge\delta,\qquad
 |P_{k'}(y)|\ge\delta^{q'}.
 \tag{CTV5}
\]
Also $|\omega'_{ab}|\le
R'=k'\sqrt{\delta^2+\gamma^2}$. These estimates keep every
