             -\mathcal H(q,q+\ell_s)\\
&\quad=
\Delta q\{2\log(q/2)+3+F(2,\vartheta)-2F_\alpha(2,\vartheta)\}
+O\bigl(\Delta(\Delta+\ell_s)\log q\bigr).
\end{split}\tag{OFV25}
