the direct logarithmic estimates in QLG9--13. The Euler constant
is bounded by evaluating OOQ3 on the compact support.
Consequently
\[
 D(x)\ge\frac{\pi}{4}\sqrt x-\frac52\log x
                         -2\log(1+x)-C\qquad(x\ge1)
