More directly the actual lower bounds
$m_e,m_o\ge n$ and upper bounds $m_e,m_o\le n+d$
together with $d/q<1/16$ verify the rate bounds.

For a polynomial $p(nz)=p_e(z^2)+z p_o(z^2)$, parity and the
