 E(\sqrt{8/9})\le\frac\pi2
 \left(1-\frac29-\frac1{27}-\frac{10}{729}\right)
 =\frac{265\pi}{729}.
\]
The identity
$22/7-\pi=\int_0^1x^4(1-x)^4/(1+x^2)\,dx>0$
