every eigenvalue lies between $Z_{k,m}^{-1}$ and one. Thus
$-r\log Z_{k,m}\le\log\det H_j^{(s)}-
\log\det(T_s^*T_s)\le0$.

The exact four original degrees are $q-1,q,2q-1,2q$. With their
