 \boxed{\max\{0,\mathcal B_k^{(s)}-2r\log Z_{k,m}\}
       \le F_B^{(s)}\le\mathcal B_k^{(s)}.}\tag{KAF21}
\]
These are statements about the original kernel and boundary, with
