$H_D^K=\mathsf C_K^*(I_0^*G_D^{\rm poly}I_0)\mathsf C_K$.
The matrix $\mathsf C_K$ is independent of $D$ and of the choice of source
order $s$. The source metrics change; the two specified coefficient
