It follows that the complete original four-endpoint kernel scalar is
\[
 \boxed{\displaystyle
 F_K^{(s)}=
 \log\det H_{q-1}^K+\log\det H_q^K
       -\log\det H_{2q-1}^K-\log\det H_{2q}^K.}
