and Gram have real entries. Each column has phase $i^n$.
Consequently
\[
 \begin{gathered}
 b_N^*G_Nb_{N+1}=i\omega_N\phi_N,\quad\phi_N\in\mathbb R,\\
 \mathcal H_N=G_N^{-1/2}D_NG_N^{-1/2}
        =\frac{yx^*+xy^*}{\omega_N},\\
